    {
      "id": "dom-ddb2ca84",
      "text": "Hub 使用内嵌 DuckDB 保存节点、历史和管理数据。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p.doc-lead:nth-of-type(2)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-8d4c9450",
      "text": "历史保留",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#section-1",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-f85c5241",
      "text": "默认分钟明细保留 30 天，小时历史保留 365 天。累计流量独立保存，不因历史清理而减少。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(3)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-7fa6157b",
      "text": "备份内容",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#section-2",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-87500923",
      "text": "备份是 gzip tar，包含持久表的 Parquet 文件和 manifest。会话表不进入备份，恢复后不会复活旧登录会话。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(4)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-1ff8d1c2",
      "text": "恢复检查",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "h2#section-3",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dom-93fbec5b",
      "text": "恢复先检查归档成员、路径、大小、关系和 SHA-256，再构建临时数据库。只有完整校验成功后才切换正式数据库。",
      "kind": "text",
      "channel": "text",
      "location": "main#main > p:nth-of-type(5)",
      "visibility": "visible",
      "attribute": null,
      "reference": null,
      "jsonPath": null,
      "redacted": false
    },
